      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City is now faced with the challenge of finding an alternative use for the Homeport in order to redress the impact of the base closure and provide new economic development benefits to the City; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1998,
